      "role": "user",
      "content": "got it. so it's more about the physical ownership vs just having the code. when we're pitching this to the partners, how should we describe the type of 'threat actors' we're worried about? like, how do we explain the difference between a typical hacker and these more targeted attacks that use SIM swapping?",
